<script setup lang="ts">
import {onMounted,reactive,ref} from 'vue';import {Gift,Save} from '@lucide/vue';import {api} from '../api';const form=reactive({initialGrantCents:0,inviteRewardCents:0}),busy=ref(false),message=ref(''),error=ref('');onMounted(async()=>{try{Object.assign(form,await api('/admin/settings/quota'))}catch(e){error.value=(e as Error).message}});async function save(){try{busy.value=true;await api('/admin/settings/quota',{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify(form)});message.value='额度设置已保存';error.value=''}catch(e){error.value=(e as Error).message}finally{busy.value=false}}
</script>
<template><main class="workspace admin-workspace"><header><div><p class="eyebrow">资金与运营</p><h1>额度设置</h1><p>设置只影响保存后创建的新账户和新生成的邀请，不追溯修改历史余额。</p></div></header><p v-if="error" class="message">{{error}}</p><p v-if="message" class="status-ok">{{message}}</p><section class="settings-card"><div class="section-heading"><div><Gift :size="20"/><h2>账户赠送规则</h2></div></div><form class="form-grid" @submit.prevent="save"><label>新用户初始额度（元）<input :value="form.initialGrantCents/100" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" @input="form.initialGrantCents=Math.round(Number(($event.target as HTMLInputElement).value)*100)"/><small>通过密码、OAuth 或管理员创建的新账户统一进入不可变赠送账本。</small></label><label>邀请者奖励（元）<input :value="form.inviteRewardCents/100" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" @input="form.inviteRewardCents=Math.round(Number(($event.target as HTMLInputElement).value)*100)"/><small>每个邀请码只能被一个账户核销，奖励写入独立账目。</small></label><button class="primary compact" :disabled="busy"><Save :size="16"/>保存设置</button></form></section></main></template>
